{"title":"Dilworth","uid":"3d668452451a2324e814f841a29e20c0","slug":"Dilworth","date":"2021-12-10T02:12:37.000Z","updated":"2022-06-06T06:57:41.697Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/Dilworth.json","keywords":"HerikoDeltana,HRiver2,","cover":null,"content":"<p>「Dilworth 定理浅谈。」</p>\r\n<span id=\"more\"></span>\r\n<!-- toc -->\r\n<p>主要参考：<a href=\"https://cmwqf.github.io/2019/12/17/%E6%B5%85%E8%B0%88Dilworth%E5%AE%9A%E7%90%86/\">浅谈Dilworth定理\r\n- cmwqf</a>。</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"启\">「启」</h2>\r\n<p>想起来这个定理，是因为我在古远的时候（大约今年 <span class=\"math inline\">3</span>\r\n月？）遇到了但是没有进一步了解，今天突然又看到导弹拦截这道题，于是就想把它进一步里了解一下。</p>\r\n<h2 id=\"定理内容\">「定理内容」</h2>\r\n<p><strong>偏序集上最小链划分中链的数量等于其反链长度的最大值。</strong></p>\r\n<p>一看，偏序集，最小链划分，反链，都不会（</p>\r\n<p>于是下面开始逐一理解 <del>看 定 义</del>（</p>\r\n<h3 id=\"偏序集\">「偏序集」</h3>\r\n<p>定义一种比较关系使得两种元素进行比较，比如我们定义 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>x</em>Aqua <em>y</em></span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>x</em>, <em>y</em> ∈ <em>Z</em></span> 且 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>x</em> ≤ <em>y</em>.</span></p>\r\n<p>显然 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>x</em></span> 和 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>y</em></span> 都满足 <span class=\"math inline\"> ∈ <em>Z</em></span>\r\n的时候她们两个是可比的，否则若有一个不满足，我们则称这两个元素不可比。</p>\r\n<p>那么偏序集 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>S</em></span>\r\n就定义为满足以下性质的允许存在不可比元素的集合：</p>\r\n<ol type=\"1\">\r\n<li><p>自反性：<span class=\"math inline\">∀<em>x</em> ∈ <em>S</em>, <em>x</em> ≤ <em>x</em>;</span></p></li>\r\n<li><p>对称性：<span class=\"math inline\">∀<em>x</em>, <em>y</em> ∈ <em>S</em>, <em>x</em> ≤ <em>y</em> ⇒ <em>y</em> ≥ <em>x</em>;</span></p></li>\r\n<li><p>传递性：<span class=\"math inline\">∀<em>x</em>, <em>y</em>, <em>z</em> ∈ <em>S</em>, <em>x</em> ≤ <em>y</em>, <em>y</em> ≤ <em>z</em> ⇒ <em>x</em> ≤ <em>z</em>.</span></p></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<h3 id=\"链划分\">「链划分」</h3>\r\n<p>若我们把满足 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>x</em>, <em>y</em> ∈ <em>S</em>, <em>x</em> ≤ <em>y</em></span>\r\n的 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>x</em>, <em>y</em></span> 之间建立一条\r\n<span class=\"math inline\"><em>x</em> → <em>y</em></span>\r\n的边，那么显然的是偏序集是一张 DAG.</p>\r\n<p>把 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>S</em></span>\r\n中的元素划分为若干条链，使得每个元素都在且仅在唯一的一条链中，叫做<strong>链划分</strong>。</p>\r\n<h3 id=\"反链\">「反链」</h3>\r\n<p>链是 DAG\r\n上的某条路径上的元素，而反链和链的定义恰好相反，对于一个集合，它是反链当且仅当这个集合里的元素两两都是不可比的，即这个集合中的元素两两不连通。</p>\r\n<p>也就是说，我们将一个偏序集 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>S</em></span>\r\n划分为若干个小集合，使得每个小集合里的元素构成一条链，这个最小的划分数量，等于这个偏序集最长的反链的长度。</p>\r\n<p>然后就能利用这个来做一些看起来很难的题。</p>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p>以下摘自我的杂题记录。</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<h2 id=\"例题\">「例题」</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://www.luogu.com.cn/problem/P3974\">洛谷 | P3974\r\n组合数学 [TJOI2015]</a> \r\n</li></ul>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p>好喵一题。</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p>其实做这道题只是在看自己之前的博客的时候想起来之前有个 Dilworth\r\n定理，然后就随着<a href=\"https://cmwqf.github.io/2019/12/17/%E6%B5%85%E8%B0%88Dilworth%E5%AE%9A%E7%90%86/\">一个博客（浅谈Dilworth定理\r\n- cmwqf）</a>学习的时候，找到了这道题。</p>\r\n<p>众所周知题目名字里有啥，这道题就不用啥做，所以这道题用不到组合数学（</p>\r\n<p>我们把这道题中的每个点 <span class=\"math inline\">(<em>i</em>,<em>j</em>)</span> 拆成 <span class=\"math inline\"><em>v</em><em>a</em><em>l</em>(<em>i</em>,<em>j</em>)</span>\r\n个点，然后把能够到达的点之间连边，最后变成了一个\r\nDAG，题目所求就是求这个图的最小链的划分，根据 Dilworth 定理，这个 DAG\r\n的最小链划分就等于它的最长反链的长度。</p>\r\n<p>按照我们建图的操作来说的话，这个反链就是说的最长的不能到达的链，也就是说要求每个点的右上和左下矩阵中点权值的最大值，于是直接\r\nDP 即可。</p>\r\n<div class=\"sourceCode\" id=\"cb1\"><pre class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><code class=\"sourceCode cpp\"><span id=\"cb1-1\"><a href=\"#cb1-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a><span class=\"cf\">for</span><span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> i<span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">);</span>i<span class=\"op\">&lt;=</span>n<span class=\"op\">;++</span>i<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-2\"><a href=\"#cb1-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"cf\">for</span><span class=\"op\">(</span><span class=\"dt\">int</span> j<span class=\"op\">(</span>m<span class=\"op\">);</span>j<span class=\"op\">;--</span>j<span class=\"op\">)</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-3\"><a href=\"#cb1-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"op\">{</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-4\"><a href=\"#cb1-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        f<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">][</span>j<span class=\"op\">]=</span>f<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">-</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">][</span>j<span class=\"op\">+</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">]+</span>a<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">][</span>j<span class=\"op\">];</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-5\"><a href=\"#cb1-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>        f<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">][</span>j<span class=\"op\">]=</span>Hmax<span class=\"op\">(</span>Hmax<span class=\"op\">(</span>f<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">][</span>j<span class=\"op\">],</span>f<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">-</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">][</span>j<span class=\"op\">]),</span>f<span class=\"op\">[</span>i<span class=\"op\">][</span>j<span class=\"op\">+</span><span class=\"dv\">1</span><span class=\"op\">]);</span></span>\r\n<span id=\"cb1-6\"><a href=\"#cb1-6\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>    <span class=\"op\">}</span></span></code></pre></div>\r\n<p>答案即为 <code>f[n][1]</code>.</p>\r\n","text":"「Dilworth 定理浅谈。」...","permalink":"/post/Dilworth","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"1.3k","symbolsTime":"1 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"OI-Theorem","slug":"OI-Theorem","count":3,"path":"api/categories/OI-Theorem.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"OI","slug":"OI","count":34,"path":"api/tags/OI.json"}],"toc":"<ol class=\"toc\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%90%AF\"><span class=\"toc-text\">「启」</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%AE%9A%E7%90%86%E5%86%85%E5%AE%B9\"><span class=\"toc-text\">「定理内容」</span></a><ol class=\"toc-child\"><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%81%8F%E5%BA%8F%E9%9B%86\"><span class=\"toc-text\">「偏序集」</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E9%93%BE%E5%88%92%E5%88%86\"><span class=\"toc-text\">「链划分」</span></a></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-3\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E5%8F%8D%E9%93%BE\"><span class=\"toc-text\">「反链」</span></a></li></ol></li><li class=\"toc-item toc-level-2\"><a class=\"toc-link\" href=\"#%E4%BE%8B%E9%A2%98\"><span class=\"toc-text\">「例题」</span></a></li></ol>","author":{"name":"Heriko Deltana","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"https://pic1.imgdb.cn/item/6991cb5c00a52e056d21cf41.png","link":"/","description":"世界が終わるまで歌おうぜ","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/HRiver2","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","wechat":"","qq":"","weibo":"","zhihu":"","csdn":"","juejin":"","customs":{"bilibili":{"icon":"/gallery/bilibili-brands.svg","link":"https://space.bilibili.com/507947803"},"Luogu":{"icon":"/gallery/user-solid.svg","link":"https://www.luogu.com.cn/user/407417"}}}},"mapped":true,"hidden":false,"prev_post":{"title":"引越しできるかな？","uid":"376aa5f89f90dd8bb634896a55dc7c51","slug":"引越しできるかな？","date":"2021-12-10T12:48:44.000Z","updated":"2022-06-06T06:56:40.137Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/引越しできるかな？.json","keywords":"HerikoDeltana,HRiver2,","cover":null,"text":"「藉以此篇，纪念刚学 OI 的我。」...","permalink":"/post/引越しできるかな？","photos":[],"count_time":{"symbolsCount":"2.4k","symbolsTime":"2 mins."},"categories":[{"name":"OI-Solutions","slug":"OI-Solutions","count":11,"path":"api/categories/OI-Solutions.json"}],"tags":[{"name":"OI","slug":"OI","count":34,"path":"api/tags/OI.json"}],"author":{"name":"Heriko Deltana","slug":"blog-author","avatar":"https://pic1.imgdb.cn/item/6991cb5c00a52e056d21cf41.png","link":"/","description":"世界が終わるまで歌おうぜ","socials":{"github":"https://github.com/HRiver2","twitter":"","stackoverflow":"","